    <!-- Description -->
    <string name="description">This app simulates a map-style interface using SurfaceView (similar to Amap/Gaode Maps). The main view is a scrollable grid rendered on SurfaceView, with native Android views for top navigation bar and bottom control panel.\n\nThis app provides 11 different load levels:\n• Minimal Load: No additional load\n• In-Frame Loads (3): Execute load during SurfaceView rendering\n• Between-Frame Loads (3): Execute load between frames\n• Mixed Loads (3): Combined in-frame and between-frame loads\n• Long Frame Load: Random 2-3 super heavy frames (10x HEAVY) per 2s</string>

